    {
      "kind": "draft_claim",
      "id": "draft-claim-draft-72a207eb-de07-466c-a446-24a1a479108a-r2-1",
      "text": "林默走进北门。",
      "sha256": "e4176f286a3ddb9f942263869e400c8c74ea13a68e2dbcbe3ed73505c7823393"
    },
    {
      "kind": "draft_claim",
      "id": "draft-claim-draft-72a207eb-de07-466c-a446-24a1a479108a-r2-2",
      "text": "林默走进北门。",
      "sha256": "e4176f286a3ddb9f942263869e400c8c74ea13a68e2dbcbe3ed73505c7823393"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-c6117355-e723-4e75-9048-0a29b7fbeb9a",
      "chapter_id": "ch-d0a7a6bf-5388-472a-8ffa-e660da935f41",
      "chapter_number": 6,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "电台在二十一点零五分收到三次短促求救码，信号来自雾线水门以外。",
      "sha256": "2d354cc208c312f81f0d4d72c682603571b1edd1bfaf6bcf3561e4e04a22dc6a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-e0244de7-c297-404e-8e39-96a0a308f111",
      "chapter_id": "ch-cf263f3d-df22-4052-8a96-5486a48920d0",
      "chapter_number": 10,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "北潮闸并未关闭，雾钟却响了一次；温岚仍握着罗盘，港外传来白色渡船的汽笛。",
      "sha256": "183759380df3c5c073ba0256d25ae7426cb03fc193282a5f791b26586f45103b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-805fe3ba-2aa2-4197-bc4c-2ea14052c650",
      "chapter_id": "ch-69fc926e-2134-4d2b-bf87-e790a38e1718",
      "chapter_number": 9,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "进入仓道前，苏岑把带月牙裂纹的黄铜罗盘交到温岚手里保管。",
      "sha256": "c118f3d296dfb8d143c3b0b5467637a24e73f833356f845d5d5c7596956d88a5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-87dfcaf5-f202-41c2-b508-6a4da8858ecb",
      "chapter_id": "ch-212b3739-61ca-464b-a32c-7e115107077e",
      "chapter_number": 8,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "温岚把北堤值守簿交给苏岑，两人约定不再各自隐瞒新线索。",
      "sha256": "356f1372376d61df6ed9af380f9c17ca332b58e5d8e09396df79e419eb5fd18a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-3837eadc-b19c-4f7a-9249-478ced5df502",
      "source_span_id": "span-18862fa2-ae4b-424c-ab82-ab577c06f1de",
      "text": "雾线水门外锚柱",
      "sha256": "364a41b7ccb226b487b22c1ca8c19df403c7d951678a34979003acf57e4a072e"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-4d50fc82-16ec-4346-855b-85abea298172",
      "source_span_id": "span-c6117355-e723-4e75-9048-0a29b7fbeb9a",
      "text": "第6章 21:05 收到三次求救码",
      "sha256": "7556dfa1c21c2596152b98090557914768c4a70b2db0c1c03ce3d6a93349e316"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-527d1d89-710a-409a-855d-a343e359f6e9",
      "source_span_id": "span-58d75a85-0ebd-4ddc-94b2-3570a0034fe1",
      "text": "第3章 19:20",
      "sha256": "0daa1efb0f5bab6e26354fcc18f5939cfbe755a55b86bc8ea86a6bd5bb5fe3c6"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-733ea114-e468-43fd-a42d-6641680fcb4c",
      "source_span_id": "span-3f0eebd8-cdd1-46a0-942f-debededde235",
      "text": "没有靠岸，来源未明",
      "sha256": "79fd506cc2927825ff3684e1a00e8fa6f5e8e841cc8d31f5cd4f5f81b1f23b1b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-9f02b946-75e0-4028-9d84-3bd4a493bddf",
      "source_span_id": "span-e0244de7-c297-404e-8e39-96a0a308f111",
      "text": "北潮闸未关闭时响起，原因未解",
      "sha256": "5a1ecc11587f240902b67617d5fcba571f254dc1dff4ddacd9b13321ea989b70"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-c000b53a-e5a0-47b2-91d0-4dfb8e4d7b58",
      "source_span_id": "span-1107933e-b829-4d49-ae6a-bf5f858f10ff",
      "text": "廊桥钥匙的含义",
      "sha256": "3d99a1a224bc211b22a638a8f187cd974662fc52736efc569d231bb77aa798ff"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-c23653b0-cae4-48ab-908d-1e60d76e18db",
      "source_span_id": "span-805fe3ba-2aa2-4197-bc4c-2ea14052c650",
      "text": "温岚",
      "sha256": "2fdb67447992579f8f9f0c751e36d69fbcaba84c43b2318b010edec750ef1c1b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
